  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "Thank you for calling VeloFit customer support. Your call may be recorded for quality assurance. Please wait for the next available agent.",
      "speakerId": "AUTOMATED_AGENT",
      "role": "AUTOMATED_AGENT",
      "user_id": 0,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766840856000000
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you for holding. My name is Sarah. How can I help you today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766840865400000
    },
    {
      "text": "I need to return something.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 44978,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766840870000000
    },
    {
      "text": "I can certainly look into that for you. Do you have the order number handy?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766840872000000
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes. It's VF886-09B. It's a helmet.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 44978,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766840877200000
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you. Let me pull that up... Okay, I see the Pro-Grade Helmet here, delivered about 85 days ago. To make sure I understand correctly, what specifically is the issue? Is it a technical fault or more of a preference?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766840879733333
    },
    {
      "text": "The color is just not what I thought it would be. So, a preference, I guess.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 44978,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766840894533333
    },
    {
      "text": "I see. I understand that aesthetics are important. While the color might not be to your liking, I can assure you that particular helmet has our highest five-star safety rating.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766840899799999
    },
    {
      "text": "Fine. It's still ugly. The box is unopened, I haven't even touched it. Can I return it or not?",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 44978,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766840911733332
    },
    {
      "text": "Of course. Let me just confirm the policy for you... one moment... Yes, it looks like you're well within the 90-day return window. I can absolutely process this return for you.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766840918199998
    },
    {
      "text": "About time. So what now?",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 44978,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766840930133331
    },
    {
      "text": "I've just approved the return in our system. I'm sending the pre-paid shipping label to the email address on file now. You should receive it in the next few minutes. Just print it out, attach it to the package, and drop it off.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766840931933331
    },
    {
      "text": "Whatever. Thanks, I guess.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 44978,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766840947266664
    },
    {
